{"id":1773410,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-18T15:11:21.418Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Drama"}],"homepage":"","id":1773410,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"RAIN SET ACTION","overview":"Behind every image in a film lies the possibility of another. Many possibilities. Just as behind the camera there is not only one person, but a team. Many. Different people whose collaboration leads to the one thing that then shines on the screen. But RAIN SET ACTION not only brings this to our attention; it also shows that there is nothing unimportant in the background, at the margins, or happening alongside. Gloves or no gloves, with an umbrella or without, one person arrives, another leaves, a third hurries past because it is pouring. The gaze follows, and a rhythm emerges in which, for a brief moment – between invention and reality – a world pulses.  (Original german text by Alexandra Seitz)","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":276870,"logo_path":null,"name":"Viennale","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","name":"United States of America"},{"iso_3166_1":"AT","name":"Austria"}],"release_date":"2026-09-18","revenue":0,"runtime":2,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"The Mastermind  crew filmed on location Cincinnati, Ohio (2025)","title":"RAIN SET ACTION","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6486895,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Brook Smith","original_name":"Brook Smith","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6aacff07ccfa8eaa2b71fadc","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6486897,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Julie Hanyes","original_name":"Julie Hanyes","po